  "label": "False equivalence argument",
  "description": "The meme's core argument is a false equivalence: comparing the symbolic, spiritual walls of the Vatican with the political, physical border wall proposed by Trump. This requires background knowledge of logical fallacies, specifically false equivalence, which is a common rhetorical device used to mislead by equating two things that are fundamentally different in nature, purpose, and context.",
